{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "不要一次问一堆问题", "content": "建立问对问题的习惯时，第一原则是不要一次性问一堆问题，像放鞭炮一样连续提问。例如同时问“吃饭了吗？学校还好吗？成绩出来了吗？今天一位同学有和你打招呼吗？另一位同学回来上课了吗？”孩子会不知道如何回答，而且这些问题通常只能得到“还好”“吃了”“出来了”“有没有”等简短回应，属于无效提问。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["提问习惯", "无效问题", "沟通"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a001指出不要一次问一堆问题，a002进一步说明一次只问一个问题，两者是同一原则的阐述。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "一次只问一个问题，给孩子发挥空间", "content": "不要一口气问一堆问题，而要一次只问一个问题，让孩子有发挥的空间和余地。这样孩子才能更好地回应，而不是被连续提问压得不知所措。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["提问技巧", "沟通"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "补充说明一次只问一个问题的原因", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "问开放式问题", "content": "第二原则是问开放式问题（open-ended questions）。例如问孩子“今天的球赛，你觉得最棒的一个进球、最遗憾的一个进球、最酷最炫的一个进球是什么？”这样的问题可以在不给孩子压力的情况下，自然进入聊天模式。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["开放式问题", "沟通", "提问技巧"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a003提出问开放式问题，a004解释开放式问题与封闭式问题的区别，支持开放式问题的定义。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "开放式问题与封闭式问题的区别", "content": "开放式问题是指不能用“是/不是”“好/不好”等简短回答的问题。例如“今天学校好吗？”是封闭式问题，孩子可能只回答“好”；而“今天学校发生了什么有趣的事情？”是开放式问题，孩子无法用简短选择性回答。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["开放式问题", "封闭式问题", "提问类型"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a003", "kind": "defines", "condition": "解释开放式问题的定义", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a005", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "无", "reason": "a004对比开放式与封闭式问题，a005指出父母常用封闭式问题，形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "observation", "title": "父母常用封闭式问题", "content": "很多父母在与孩子交谈提问时，大部分时间使用封闭式问题，例如“你今天想吃鸡还是想吃鸭？”这类问题限制了孩子的回答。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["封闭式问题", "父母习惯"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "举例说明封闭式问题", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "问更具体的问题", "content": "第三原则是问更具体的问题。当孩子回家脸色难看、摔门进房间时，不要问“怎么啦？脸色这么难看？”“你吃炸药了？”这类宽泛问题，而应问更具体的问题，例如“我看你的脸色很难看，情绪有些低落，你心情不好吗？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["具体问题", "情绪关注", "提问技巧"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a007", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a006提出问更具体的问题，a007解释具体问题有效的原因，支持该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a010", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a006和a010都强调具体问题提供切入点，a010进一步说明具体问题引导孩子展开话题。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a008", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "当孩子给出具体回答后", "reason": "a006提出问具体问题，a008说明从具体问题到开放式问题的衔接，是提问流程中的一步。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "具体问题给孩子指明方向", "content": "具体问题之所以有效，是因为它给问题加了一个方向。例如先讨论情绪，就给孩子指明了一个方向，让他知道如何具体回答。如果孩子说“没有情绪，主要是肚子有点痛”，就可以继续问更具体的生理问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["具体问题", "引导", "情绪"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "解释具体问题的作用机制", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "example", "title": "从具体问题到开放式问题的衔接", "content": "如果孩子说“今天不爽，打球打输了”，可以立刻接着问开放式问题：“打球是什么样的情况呢？你跟我说说看。”这个问题邀请孩子进入对话，让孩子觉得你懂他、认识他。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["开放式问题", "具体问题", "对话引导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a003", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "展示开放式问题的应用", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "从具体问题过渡到开放式问题", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "概括性问题让孩子难以回答", "content": "问题太概括时，孩子会不知道怎么回答，因为孩子的大脑组织能力不如成人快，需要先控制好心情，再把心情转化成语言表述出来。这个过程对孩子来说是练习，孩子越小越需要训练。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["概括性问题", "儿童发展", "语言表达"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "解释为什么需要具体问题", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a010", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "无", "reason": "a009说明概括性问题让孩子难以回答，a010说明具体问题提供切入点，两者形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "具体问题提供切入点", "content": "如果问题太概括，孩子不知道从哪里切入回答。因此问题应引导孩子，给孩子一个切入点，让他从小点开始越讲越多。例如问“今天是怎么了？为什么情绪这么低落呢？”孩子可能回答“输球了，而且肚子又痛”，从而展开话题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["切入点", "具体问题", "引导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "说明具体问题如何提供切入点", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a011", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a010和a011都强调小问题引导孩子向外扩张，a011进一步解释小切入点让孩子有自由。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "小问题引导孩子向外扩张", "content": "提问时应提小的、具体的问题，慢慢引导孩子向外扩张，而不是给一个很扩张的问题（如“怎么啦？吃炸药啦？”）让孩子向内缩小。孩子不具备向内缩小的能力，面对大问题时会放弃多讲。而小切入点让孩子有自由，可以凭自己的想法走向想谈的方向，使谈话过程有趣。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["提问策略", "引导", "儿童能力"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014", "b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a010", "kind": "supports", "condition": "进一步解释小切入点的优势", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "问建立关系的问题", "content": "第四原则是问建立关系的问题。问题应有目的性，即建立和孩子之间的关系，让孩子成为对关系感兴趣的人。例如问“老师这样说你的时候，你有什么样的感觉？”“老师今天夸你的时候，你心情怎么样？”“老师今天批评你的时候，你当时是什么样的感觉？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["建立关系", "情绪问题", "提问目的"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a012提出问建立关系的问题，a013说明情绪问题可以建立关系，支持该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a012提出建立关系的问题，a015说明这类问题传递关注内在的信息，支持该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "情绪问题建立关系", "content": "任何关于情绪的问题都可以和孩子建立关系，因为孩子一旦认为自己的情绪得到关注和理解，关系就建立起来了。因此应尽可能多问孩子的感受，例如“你感觉怎么样？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["情绪关注", "关系建立", "感受"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "解释为什么情绪问题能建立关系", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a013强调情绪问题建立关系，a014说明孩子不习惯谈感受时的应对，补充该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "孩子不习惯谈感受时的应对", "content": "孩子最初可能回答“我不知道”“没什么感觉”，不要灰心。孩子可能只是不习惯讲感觉，只要慢慢习惯，就会自然开始聊感觉。即使孩子不回答，提问本身也抛出了橄榄枝，让孩子知道父母对他感兴趣，这也是建立关系的重要一步。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["感受表达", "耐心", "关系建立"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "补充孩子不回应时的处理", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "建立关系的问题传递关注内在的信息", "content": "建立关系的问题非常有力量，因为它传递给孩子一个信息：父母不仅关注外在（身高、饭量、成绩、体育），也关注内在的情绪和心理健康。例如问“你的脸色看来不太好，心情不好吗？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["内在关注", "心理健康", "信息传递"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00019"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "说明建立关系问题的深层作用", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "问鼓励性的问题", "content": "第五原则是问鼓励性的问题。例如问“你觉得你做了什么让你拿到第一名？”“你觉得是什么原因让你这一次让大家都选你当班长？”“你觉得是你性格上的什么优点让大家这么喜欢你？”这些问题能鼓励孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["鼓励性提问", "优点", "成就"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00020"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a018", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "无", "reason": "a016提出问鼓励性的问题，a018是讲师问孩子的具体例子，属于鼓励性问题的实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a019", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a016提出鼓励性问题，a019用成人类比说明鼓励性问题的作用，支持该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "孩子期待被提问的案例", "content": "讲师分享自己孩子的案例：孩子每天晚上都非常期待被提问，会主动说“妈妈，你今天还没有问我问题呢”。因为孩子知道这些问题让他感到被理解、被认识、被喜欢。孩子会提醒妈妈问“今天最高兴的事情是什么”“最悲伤的事情是什么”“最期待的事情是什么”“最兴奋的事情是什么”。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["期待提问", "被理解", "亲子关系"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a016", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "展示鼓励性问题的效果", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-c-16", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：孩子期待被提问并因此感到被了解/被认识/被喜欢时；区别：候选为讲师孩子案例，旧原子是目标定义。", "reason": "候选案例证明坚持提问能让孩子感到被了解、被认识、被喜欢，为旧原子目标提供正面证据。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "鼓励性问题让孩子自我肯定", "content": "讲师经常问孩子“为什么你走在路上，大家都要跟你打招呼？”孩子会回答“因为我是孩子啊，因为我很可爱呀。”这种提问鼓励了孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["自我肯定", "鼓励", "孩子回应"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a016", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "具体展示鼓励性问题", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "analogy", "title": "鼓励性问题对成人的类比", "content": "讲师用配偶和领导的例子类比：如果配偶每天问“老婆，是什么让你的皮肤保持这么光滑？”“为什么别人生孩子都长胖了，你身材还这么好？”或者领导问“为什么别人做不到的事，交到你手上就做到了？”会让人上班很有干劲，像打了鸡血。孩子也是一样，父母应注重问让孩子感到兴奋的问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["类比", "鼓励", "动力"], "evidence": "metaphor", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023", "b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a016", "kind": "supports", "condition": "用成人例子说明鼓励性问题的普遍效果", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "用问题来回答问题", "content": "第六原则是用问题来回答问题。当孩子大一点时，会问很多问题，父母有时不耐烦或不知道答案，但没关系。告诉孩子答案很重要，但更重要的是帮助孩子思考世界，所以要用问题回答孩子的问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["反问", "思考能力", "提问技巧"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00025"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a021", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "无", "reason": "a020提出用问题回答问题，a021是具体案例，展示如何用问题回答孩子的问题。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a022", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "a020提出用问题回答问题，a022解释反问帮助孩子建立处理问题的技巧，支持该原则。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-05", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "两者均讨论用问题回答问题，帮助孩子思考而非直接给答案。", "reason": "内容一致：用问题回答问题帮助孩子思考世界。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "用问题回答孩子问题的案例", "content": "孩子看到一个小女孩在冰激凌柜前尖叫跺脚不肯走，妈妈在拉她，孩子问“为什么那个妹妹尖叫？”习惯性回答是“可能她妈不给她买冰激凌吧”。但更好的做法是反问：“宝贝，你觉得呢？为什么她这么伤心？她看起来不单单有伤心，而且好像还有一些生气呢？”孩子不知道，家长提示“去看一下呢”，孩子观察到是冰激凌店，然后自己推理：也许她想吃冰激凌，妈妈拉她走，她不想走。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["反问案例", "观察推理", "儿童思考"], "evidence": "hypothetical", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a021", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00026", "b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a020", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "展示如何用问题回答问题", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "反问帮助孩子建立处理问题的技巧", "content": "当孩子问问题，父母以提问方式反问回去时，孩子会开始寻找答案，观察并收集信息，而不是被动接受答案。给予答案时孩子大脑不怎么用，而自己回答问题时，孩子会观察、寻求答案，从而建立处理问题的技巧。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["反问", "问题解决", "主动思考"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a022", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e385ae045fc0", "blocks": ["b00028", "b00029"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e385ae045fc0-c001:a020", "kind": "supports", "condition": "解释反问的益处", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:xg-r-05", "kind": "complements", "condition": "两者均讨论用问题回答问题的具体认知效果。", "reason": "候选补充反问让孩子自己搜集信息、建立处理问题的技巧。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e385ae045fc0-c001:u022"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
